From 1c19e49c4531256b24690506b3602288cf876b2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: grep <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 08:51:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] vayu-0140: SM8150 (Poco X3 Pro) platform next to topaz

sweet_soc_vayu() reads the ADT root compatible (xiaomi,vayu). On vayu:
sweet's 8-core MPIDR layout and boot CPU 0, MDSS at 0xae00000 with the
splash SSPP and the INTF_1 CTL found at runtime, keys on SM8150 SPMI
(PM8150 PON + GPIO6), and the SM6225-only drivers (FT5452 touch, I2C
gauge, cpufreq, TopazModem) stay off.
---
 bsd/dev/sweet_cpufreq.c               |  4 ++
 bsd/dev/sweet_keys.c                  | 50 +++++++++++++-------
 bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c                 | 10 ++++
 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetBattery.cpp     | 12 ++++-
 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetCPU.cpp         | 23 ++++++---
 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp | 67 +++++++++++++++++++++++----
 iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazModem.cpp       |  6 +++
 osfmk/arm64/sweet_early.c             | 35 ++++++++++++++
 osfmk/arm64/sweet_early.h             |  1 +
 9 files changed, 173 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

